// Secrets.example.xcconfig
// followtrend
//
// Template for local secrets. To set up:
//   1. Copy this file to `Secrets.xcconfig` in the same folder.
//   2. Fill in the real values below.
//
// `Secrets.xcconfig` is gitignored, so your keys never get committed. The app
// target's Debug/Release configs use it as their base configuration, and
// `Info.plist` maps `PROXY_SECRET` → the `ProxySecret` key that APIConfig reads.
// If `Secrets.xcconfig` is absent, the build still succeeds and the app falls
// back to mock data (empty secret).

// Bearer token for the crypto proxy (crypto-proxy-221x.onrender.com).
PROXY_SECRET =
